/E (Crucially, regex counts remain reliably proportional to neural outputs across patterns and registers, allowing meaningful register analysis without a neural pipeline. Regex also outperforms Stanza on conjunctive verbs in both registers \(0.63 vs 0.45 on broadcast, 0.71 vs 0.50 on comments\), indicating that for morphologically regular, surface-predictable patterns, rule-based methods can remain competitive even on noisy, real-world text.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [2]
>>
